      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "With the whole \"MYBP (Maybe You've Been Pwned)\" posting talking about \"ease to typing passwords in VR\", PLEASE MAKE THIS A THING. \nAgain, if it was easier to type in passwords by just going to keyboard and typing it in while being able to see the field is actively selected on your monitor while still in VR, it would fix this issue for many of us.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "60177f1e9e6a186863402bff",
