      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5d7322991ba4827d4243fb75",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I really wish this was a thing, especially with the amount of times I have to login with the authentication failing after small updates.\nIt is beyond frustrating to put your VR set on, start up the game, hear the Login Required sound, before having to tilt your head at an extreme angle to SEE THE SCREEN, and then go over to your desktop, type in a password while not being able to see anything before hoping that you typed into the right field. Oh what's that, VRChat isn't selected? NOPE, you typed it into your Notepad application opened.\nPlease... I want a flat version of the login screen on my desktop while SteamVR is active...",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
